---
title: "Callout kinds, icons, and appearances"
---

The five callout kinds each carry a bundled icon and a theme-aware accent.

::: {.callout-note}
A note. The default boxed appearance with a tinted title bar.
:::

::: {.callout-tip}
A tip worth surfacing.
:::

::: {.callout-warning}
A warning the reader should not miss.
:::

::: {.callout-important}
Something important, with a title bar derived from the kind accent.
:::

::: {.callout-caution}
Proceed with caution.
:::

The appearance and icon are configurable.

::: {.callout-tip appearance="simple"}
`appearance="simple"` drops the tinted title bar; the border and icon carry the kind.
:::

::: {.callout-warning appearance="minimal"}
`appearance="minimal"` also drops the left accent for a quieter aside.
:::

::: {.callout-note icon="false"}
`icon="false"` suppresses the icon entirely.
:::
